        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 174, 9 Inch Classic Hobnail Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 9 Inch Hobnail Cabinet Pull is part of MNG's Vanilla Collection which features unique beaded designs that are subtle yet stunning. The 9 Inch Classic Hobnail Cabinet Pull is available in traditional finish colors for maximum effect. These kitchen cabinet pulls are beautiful and classic and will surely add a richness to your cabinets with their texture. The Hobnail Cabinet Pull has 9 inch mounting centers and is 9.5 inches overall. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Vanilla\">MNG Vanilla Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 174 Hobnail 9 Inch Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 9\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 9-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
